      ["\"I can speak Tagalog\" (I know how) is…",["Puwede akong mag-Tagalog","Gusto kong mag-Tagalog","Kailangan kong mag-Tagalog","Marunong akong mag-Tagalog"],3,"marunong is \"know how to\"; puwede is \"may, allowed\"."]
